\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Hark, how the watchmen cry!
\par Attend the trumpet's sound!
\par Stand to your arms, the foe is nigh,
\par The powers of hell surround:
\par Who bow to Christ's command.
\par Your arms and hearts prepare!
\par The day of battle is at hand!
\par Go forth to glorious war!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Go up with Christ your Head.
\par Your Captain's footsteps see;
\par Follow your Captain, and be led
\par To certain victory.
\par All power to Him is given,
\par He ever reigns the same;
\par Salvation, happiness, and heaven
\par Are all in Jesu's name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesu's tremendous name
\par Put all our foes to flight:
\par Jesus, the meek, the angry lamb,
\par A Lion is in fight.
\par By all hell's host withstood,
\par We all hell's host o'erthrow;
\par And conquering them, through Jesu's blood,
\par We still to conquer go.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Our Captain leads us on;
\par He beckons from the skies,
\par And reaches out a starry crown,
\par And bids us take a prize:
\par Be faithful unto death,
\par Partake my victory;
\par And thou shalt wear this glorious wreath,
\par And thou shalt reign with Me!
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2 
\par }

